<title>NETHERLANDS: Nutricia to split shares five for one.</title>
<headline>Nutricia to split shares five for one.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food group Nutricia NV said on Friday it will propose to its shareholders to split the shares, with each existing share being divided into five new ones.</p>
<p>This will change the nominal value of the shares to 0.50 guilders from 2.50.</p>
<p>The shares will be split to stimulate trade, Nutricia said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
